  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-134354",
  "summary": "rclone 1.59.0 before 1.76.0 Symlink Escape via Extended Attribute Metadata Write",
  "details": "rclone from 1.59.0 before 1.76.0 contains a confinement escape in the local backend's setXattr function that lets attackers write user.* extended attributes outside the destination root via a planted symlink. Attackers who plant a symlink to an outside directory with a pre-existing child can use --links --metadata operations to set attacker-chosen user.* xattrs on files outside the destination.",
